Hi! We=E2=80=99re closing out the WGLC on this I-D. Once we come to =
closure on Martin=E2=80=99s comments we will progress this.

spt

> On Aug 5, 2025, at 10:25, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>=20
>>=20
>> On Jul 28, 2025, at 10:57, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>>=20
>>=20
>>> On Jul 24, 2025, at 03:00, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>>>=20
>>> This is the working group last call for Legacy RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 =
codepoints for TLS 1.3. Please review draft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1 [1] and =
reply to this thread indicating if you think it is ready for publication =
or not.  If you do not think it is ready please indicate why.  This call =
will end on at 2359 UTC on 07 August 2024.
>>>=20
>>> Cheers,
>>> spt
>>=20
>>=20
>> [1] https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1/
>>=20
>> Just a reminder that this is still on-going (and this time with the =
correct link).
>=20
> Final reminder that this is still ongoing.
>=20
> Cheers,
> spt


